    "summary": "Female figure carved from elephant ivory with a rounded head, flat at the top and inserted with a loop of metal wire. The torso is decorated with circlar motifs in a &#039;X&#039; pattern across the front and with two rows of eight motifs along the centre of the back. The back is also carved with two deep vertical lines and a series of horizontal carved marks which radiate from the spine to the arms.The right ankle has a small circular motif. The figure is hollow.",
